    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There has been a rift created between realities, and they're calling it &quot;The Schism&quot;. The Schism is a sci-fy horror game, where you - a world renown scientist -\u00a0 must gather useful intel to aid the government's containment plan. You will enter compromised locations, and set about your tasks to collect critical information. But beware, your not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851220/extras/2da9ab1976666cdd05fe505e2539c415.avif?t=1750709078\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Schism features immersive survival mechanics. As your fear increases, an ever growing amount of danger follows in your wake, with immersive hallucinations. Stay alive by keeping calm using a variety of special objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using unpredictable AI, The Schism ensures that each playthrough is unique. This is not a game you play once and throw away. The Schism can offer endless enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environments</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851220/extras/237e751b35aa4efbe13c153f14229d04.avif?t=1750709078\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are highly immersive detailed environments with stunning graphical fidelity. The list of environments you can play in is constantly increasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plans</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are massive plans for The Schism. New monsters, maps, and tasks. If you can name it, we've planned it. You can be rest assured, of your investment to this game, as new content will be fundamental. If you have any ideas for new additions however, please reach out in the steam reviews section.</p>",
